{"step_index":136,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T20:27:05Z","thinking":"**Defining the Upload Service**\n\nThe upload service must validate file extensions, restricting uploads to `.txt`, `.csv`, and `.json` files. An appropriate exception will be raised for unsupported formats. The SHA256 hash of the uploaded content will be calculated and passed for further processing by the extraction service. Finally, the evidence will be stored, and the case's evidence count updated, before returning an upload response.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add InvalidUploadError to errors.py","EndLine":34,"Instruction":"Add InvalidUploadError class","ReplacementContent":"class EntityNotFoundError(NexusException):\n    def __init__(self, entity_id: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            message=f\"Entity with ID '{entity_id}' was not found in the investigation database.\",\n            status_code=status.HTTP_404_NOT_FOUND,\n            details={\"entity_id\": entity_id}\n        )\n\n\nclass InvalidUploadError(NexusException):\n    def __init__(self, message: str, details: dict = None):\n        super().__init__(\n            message=message,\n            status_code=status.HTTP_400_BAD_REQUEST,\n            details=details or {}\n        )","StartLine":24,"TargetContent":"class EntityNotFoundError(NexusException):\n    def __init__(self, entity_id: str):\n        super().__init__(\n            message=f\"Entity with ID '{entity_id}' was not found in the investigation database.\",\n            status_code=status.HTTP_404_NOT_FOUND,\n            details={\"entity_id\": entity_id}\n        )","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\backend\\app\\utils\\errors.py","toolAction":"Updating errors.py","toolSummary":"Update app/utils/errors.py"}}]}
